msgstr "FV_ເງີນປີ(1000;0.05;5) ເທົ່າກັບ 5525.63"

#: xml_doc.cc:733 xml_doc.cc:740
msgid "Principal"
msgstr "ເງີນຕົ້ນ"

#: xml_doc.cc:735
msgid "Periods per year"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາຕໍ່ປີ"

#: xml_doc.cc:736 xml_doc.cc:742 xml_doc.cc:758 xml_doc.cc:765
msgid "Years"
msgstr "ປີ"

#: xml_doc.cc:737
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The COMPOUND() function returns the value of an investment, given the "
"principal, nominal interest rate, compounding frequency and time. For "
"example: $5000 at 12% interest compounded quarterly for 5 years will become "
"COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) or $9030.56."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຂອງ COMPOUND() "
"ແມ່ນໃຫ້ຄ່າຂອງການລົງທຶນ,ດ້ວ"
"ຍເງີນຕົ້ນ,ອັດຕາເລັກນ້ອຍຂອງ"
"ອັດຕາດອກເບັ້ຍ,ການປະສົມຄວາມ"
"ຖີ່ແລະເວລາ ຕົວຢ່າງ: $5000 "
"ທີ່ດອກເບັ້ຍທົບຕົ້ນທຸກໆສາມ"
"ເດືອນ12%ພາຍໃນຫ້າປ ີຈະກາຍເປັນ "
"COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) ຫຼື $9030.56."

#: xml_doc.cc:738
msgid "COMPOUND(initial;interest;periods;periods_per_year)"
msgstr ""
"COMPOUND(ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ;ອັດຕາດອກເບ້ຍ;ຊ"
"່ວງເວລາ;ຊ່ວງເວລາ_ຕໍ່_ປີ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:739
msgid "COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) equals 9030.56"
msgstr "COMPOUND(5000;0.12;4;5) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 9030.56"

#: xml_doc.cc:743
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The CONTINUOUS() function calculates the return on continuously compounded "
"interest, given the principal, nominal rate and time in years. For example: "
"$1000 earning 10% for 1 year becomes CONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) or $1105.17."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຂອງThe CONTINUOUS() ຄິດໄລ່ "
"ການໃຫ້ການຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຂອງດອກເ"
"ບ້ຍທົບຕົ້ນ,ດ້ວຍເງີນຕົ້ນ , "
"ອັດຕາເລັກນ້ອຍແລະເວລາໃນແຕ່"
"ລະປີ.ຕົວຢ່າງ:ພາຍໃນ1ປີ "
"$1000ໄດ້ຮັບ10%ຈະກາຍເປັນCONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) "
"ຫຼື  $1105.17."

#: xml_doc.cc:744
msgid "CONTINOUS(principal;interest;years)"
msgstr ""
"CONTINOUS(ເງີນຕົ້ນ;ອັດຕາດອກເບ້ຍ;ປ"
"ີ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:745
msgid "CONTINUOUS(1000;0.1;1) equals 1105.17"
msgstr "CONTINUOUS(1000;0.1;1) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1105.17"

#: xml_doc.cc:746
msgid "Nominal interest rate"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາເລັກນ້ອຍຂອງອັດຕາດອກເ"
"ບ້ຍ"

#: xml_doc.cc:748
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The EFFECT() function calculates the effective yield for a nominal interest "
"rate (annual rate or APR). For example: 8% interest compounded monthly "
"provides an effective yield of EFFECT(.08;12) or 8.3%."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຂອງ EFFECT() "
"ແມ່ນການຄຳນວນຫາຜົນກະທົບຂອງ"
"ການໃຫ "
"້ອັດຕາດອກເບ້ຍເລັກນ້ອຍ "
"(ອັດຕາຂອງທຸກໆປີ rate or APR).  "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ອັດຕາດອກເບ້ຍ8%ທີ່ປະສົມກັບຜົ"
"ນກະທົບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
"ແຕ່ລະເດືອນ ແມ່ນ EFFECT(.08;12) ຫຼື 8.3%."

#: xml_doc.cc:749
msgid "EFFECT(nominal;periods)"
msgstr "EFFECT(ເລັກນ້ອຍ;ຊ່ວງເວລາ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:750
msgid "EFFECT(0.08;12) equals 0.083"
msgstr "EFFECTIVE(0.08;12) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0.083"

#: xml_doc.cc:751
msgid "Effective interest rate"
msgstr "ຜົນຂອງອັດຕາດອກເບ້ຍ"

#: xml_doc.cc:753
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The NOMINAL() function calculates the nominal (stated) interest rate for an "
"effective (annualized) interest rate compounded at given intervals. For "
"example: to earn 8% on an account compounded monthly, you need a return of "
"NOMINAL(.08;12) or 7.72%."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຂອງ NOMINAL() "
"ແມ່ນຄຳນວນຫາອັດຕາດອກເບັ້ຍເ"
"ລັກນ້ອຍ "
"(ໃນບັນຊີ)ເພື່ອຫາຜົນຂອງອັດຕາ"
"ດອກເບ້ຍ(ທຸກໆປີ)ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ"
"ເວລາຂອງການຈ່າຍ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:ເພື່ອຫາລາຍໄດ້ 8% "
"ໃນບັນຊີລາຍເດືອນ,ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຫ"
"້ຄ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ (.08;12) ຫຼື7.72%."

#: xml_doc.cc:754
msgid "NOMINAL(effective;periods)"
msgstr "NOMINAL(ຜົນ;ຊ່ວງເວລາ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:755
msgid "NOMINAL(0.08;12) equals 0.0772"
msgstr "NOMINAL(0.08;12) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0.0772"

#: xml_doc.cc:756 xml_doc.cc:762
msgid "Face value"
msgstr "ລາຄາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້"

#: xml_doc.cc:759
msgid ""
"The ZERO_COUPON() function calculates the value of a zero-coupon (pure "
"discount) bond. For example: if the interest rate is 10%, a $1000 bond that "
