msgstr "LCD(20;15;10) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:962
msgid ""
"The LCD() function returns the largest common denominator for two or more "
"integer values."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັ້ນ DATE() "
"ຈະຄືນຄ່າກັບມາເປັນຄ່າຮູຸບແ"
"ບບວັນທີຕາມພາສາທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງ"
"ໄວ້"

#: xml_doc.cc:963
msgid ""
"This function is obsolete and will be removed in a later version of KSpread. "
"It is provided only for compatibility. Please use the GCD function instead."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ແມ່ນສຸງສຸດ ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະຖືກເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໃນຮູບແບ"
"ບຂອງ KSpread. ລ່າສຸດ. "
"ມັນໄດ້ຈັດໃຫ້ສະເພາະແຕ່ສີ່ງ"
"ທີໂກງກັນ. "
"ກະລຸນາໄປໃໍຊ້ຟັງຊັນ GCD ແທນ"

#: xml_doc.cc:964
msgid "LCD(value; value)"
msgstr "LCD(ຄ່າ; ຄ່າ;)"

#: xml_doc.cc:965
msgid ""
"EPS() returns the machine epsilon; this is the difference between 1 and the "
"next largest floating-point number. Because computers use a finite number of "
"digits, roundoff error is inherent (but usually insignificant) in all "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"EPS() "
"ກາຍເປັນເຄື່ອງ່ຈັກແອັບຊີລອ"
"ນ;ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າ"
"ງ 1 ກັບ "
"ຈຳນວນຄ່າເສດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ສຸດ. "
"ເພາະວ່າຄອມພິວເຕີຈະໃໍ້່ໍຊ້"
"ຕົວເລກແບບຖານ 2 "

#: xml_doc.cc:966
msgid "EPS()"
msgstr "EPS()"

#: xml_doc.cc:967
msgid "On most systems, this returns 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16"
msgstr "On most systems, this returns 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16"

#: xml_doc.cc:968
msgid ""
"0.5*EPS() returns the \"unit round\"; this value is interesting because it "
"is the largest number x where (1+x)-1=0 (due to roundoff errors)."
msgstr ""
"0.5*EPS() ສົ່ງຄ່າ \"ໜ່ວຍອອ້ມ\"; "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຫນ້າສົມໃຈ "
"ມັນແມ່ນຕົວເລກທີ່ໃຫຍ່ x "
"ຢູ່ບ່ອນ (1+x)-1=0 (ລະຫວ່າງ "
"ທີ່ມີການຜິດພາດ)."

#: xml_doc.cc:969
msgid "EPS() is so small that KSpread displays 1+eps() as 1"
msgstr "EPS() ແມ່ນນອ້ຍ KSpread ສະແດງ 1+eps() ຫາ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:970
msgid ""
"Pick a number x between 0 and EPS(). Observe that 1+x rounds x to either 0 "
"or EPS() by using the equation (1+x)-1"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລກ x ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ແລະ EPS() "
"ໄດ້ຮັບ ນັ້ນ 1 +x ອອ້ມ x ທັງສອງ 0 or "
"EPS() ຈາກ ການໃຊ້ສູດ ( 1+x)-1"

#: xml_doc.cc:973
msgid "The POWER(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y."
msgstr ""
"HOURSຟັງຊັ້ນ () "
"ຈະຄືນຄ່າກັບມາເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງຂ"
"ອງຄ່າເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ"

#: xml_doc.cc:974
msgid "POWER(value;value)"
msgstr "POW(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:975
msgid "POWER(1.2;3.4) equals 1.8572"
msgstr "POW(1.2;3.4) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1.8572"

#: xml_doc.cc:976
msgid "POWER(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POW(2;3) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 8"

#: xml_doc.cc:978
msgid ""
"The EVEN() function returns the number rounded up to the nearest even "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"EVEN() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຕົວເລ"
"ກທີ່ອອ້ມເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ຄ່າຕົ"
"ວຖ້ວນທີ່ເປັນຄ່າກຳໄລ"

#: xml_doc.cc:979
msgid "EVEN(value)"
msgstr "EVEN(value)"

#: xml_doc.cc:980
msgid "EVEN(1.2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(1.2) returns 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:981
msgid "EVEN(2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(2) returns 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:984
msgid ""
"The TRUNC() function truncates a numeric value to a certain precision. If "
"the precision is omitted 0 is assumed."
msgstr ""
"TRUNC() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ນຳຄ່າທີບັນຈຸສະຫ"
"ລຸບຖ້າວ່າຜນົສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນປ່"
"ອຍ 0 ແມ່ນ ບວກກັນ"

#: xml_doc.cc:985
msgid "TRUNC(value; precision)"
msgstr "ປ່ຽງຈຳນວນທົດນິຍົມ"

#: xml_doc.cc:986
msgid "TRUNC(1.2) returns 1"
msgstr "COUNT(5) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:987
msgid "TRUNC(213.232; 2) returns 213.23"
msgstr "ROUND(1.252;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1.25"

#: xml_doc.cc:989
msgid "The ODD() function returns the number rounded up to the nearest odd integer."
msgstr ""
"0DD() "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຕົວເລກຂື້ນເປັນຄ່າເ"
"ລກຄູ່."

#: xml_doc.cc:990
msgid "ODD(value)"
msgstr "ODD(value)"

#: xml_doc.cc:991
msgid "ODD(1.2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(1.2) returns 3"

#: xml_doc.cc:992
msgid "ODD(2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(2) returns 3 "

#: xml_doc.cc:995
msgid ""
"The MOD() function returns the remainder after division. If the second "
"parameter is null the function returns #DIV/0."
msgstr ""
"MOD() "
"ສົງຄ່າທີ່ຍັງເຫລືອຫລັງຈາກກ"
"ານລົບຖ້າຄ່າທີ່ສອງຂອງພາລາມ"
"ິເຕິີແມ່ນໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ #DIV/0"

#: xml_doc.cc:996
msgid "MOD(value;value)"
msgstr "MOD(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:997
msgid "MOD(12;5) returns 2"
msgstr "MOD(12;5) returns 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:998
msgid "MOD(5;5) returns 0"
msgstr "MOD(5;5) returns 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1000
msgid ""
"This function returns -1 if the number is negative, 0 if the number is null "
"and 1 if the number is positive."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຟັງຊັ້ນສົ່ງຄ່າ -1 "
"ຖ້າຕົວເລກແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມ, 0 "
"ຖ້າຕົວເລກແມ່ນໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"1 ຖ້າຕົວເລກແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມ"

#: xml_doc.cc:1001
msgid "SIGN(value)"
msgstr "SIGN(ຄ່າ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1002
msgid "SIGN(5) equals 1"
msgstr "SIGN(5) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1003
msgid "SIGN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "SIGN(0) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1004
msgid "SIGN(-5) equals -1"
msgstr "SIGN(-5) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1006
msgid "This function multiplies each value by -1."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັ້ນບວກຄ່າເພີ່ມແຕ່ລະຄ່"
"າຈາກ -1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1007
msgid "INV(value)"
msgstr "INV(value)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1008
msgid "INV(-5) equals 5"
msgstr "INV(-5) equals 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1009
msgid "INV(5) equals -5"
msgstr "INV(5) equals -5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1010
msgid "INV(0) equals 0"
msgstr "INV(0) equals 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1012
msgid ""
"This function returns the count of integer or floating arguments passed. You "
"can count using a range: COUNT(A1:B5) or using a list of values like "
"COUNT(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
" ຟັງຊັ້ນສົ່ງຄ່າຕົວຖ້ວນແລະ "
"ເສດ ໂດຍຜ່ານໄປ "
"ທ່ານສາມາດນັບແລະໃຊ້ : COUNT(A1 :B5) "
"ຫລືໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ "
"COUNT(12;5;12.5)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1013
msgid "COUNT(value;value;value...)"
msgstr "COUNT(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1014
msgid "COUNT(-5;\"KSpread\";2) returns 2"
msgstr "COUNT(-5;\"KSpread\";2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:1015
msgid "COUNT(5) returns 1"
msgstr "COUNT(5) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1017
msgid ""
"This function returns the count of all non empty arguments passed. You can "
"count using a range: COUNTA(A1:B5) or using a list of values like "
"COUNTA(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຟັງຊັ້ນທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກ"
"ັບໂດຍການນັບທັງຫມົດຂອງຄ່າເ"
"ປົ່າ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້: COUNTA(A1:B5) "
"ຫລືຄ້າຍຄື."

#: xml_doc.cc:1018
msgid "COUNTA(value;value;value...)"
msgstr "COUNT(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1019
msgid "COUNTA(-5;\"KSpread\";2) returns 3"
msgstr "COUNT(-5;\"KSpread\";2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:1020
msgid "COUNTA(5) returns 1"
msgstr "COUNT(5) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1021
msgid "Cell range"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າໃດຯ"

#: xml_doc.cc:1022
msgid "This function returns the count of all empty cells within the range."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັ້ນ LEN() "
"ຈະຄື່ນຄ່າກັບມາເປັນຄ່າຄວາມ"
"ຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: xml_doc.cc:1023
msgid "COUNTBLANK(range)"
msgstr "COUNTBLANK(range)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1024
msgid "COUNTBLANK(A1:B5)"
msgstr "COUNTBLANK(A1:B5)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1025
msgid "Range"
msgstr "Range"

#: xml_doc.cc:1026
msgid "Criteria"
msgstr "Criteria"

#: xml_doc.cc:1027
msgid ""
"The COUNTIF() function returns the number of cells in the given range that "
"meet the given criteria."
msgstr ""
"COUNTIF() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນແມ່ນສົ່ງຕົວເລກຈາກເ"
"ຊລໃນການໃຊ້ສູດນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງໃຫ"
"້."

#: xml_doc.cc:1028
msgid "COUNTIF(range;criteria)"
msgstr "COUNTIF(range;criteria)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1029
msgid "COUNTIF(A2:A3;\"14\") returns 1 if A1 is -4 and A2 is 14"
msgstr "COUNTIF(A2:A3;\"14\") returns 1 if A1 is -4 and A2 is 14"

#: xml_doc.cc:1030 xml_doc.cc:1035 xml_doc.cc:1102 xml_doc.cc:1107
#: xml_doc.cc:1111 xml_doc.cc:1116 xml_doc.cc:1122 xml_doc.cc:1127
#: xml_doc.cc:1131 xml_doc.cc:1136 xml_doc.cc:1141 xml_doc.cc:1146
#: xml_doc.cc:1152 xml_doc.cc:1157 xml_doc.cc:1162 xml_doc.cc:1175
#: xml_doc.cc:1190
msgid "A floating point value"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລກທົດນິຍົມ"

#: xml_doc.cc:1031
msgid ""
"The FACT() function calculates the factorial of the parameter. The "
"mathematical expression is (value)!."
msgstr ""
"FACT() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນການຄິດໄລ່ໂຮງງານຈາກ"
"ພາລາມິເຕິ້.ເລກຄະນິດແມ່ນ "
"(ຄ່າ)!."

#: xml_doc.cc:1032
msgid "FACT(number)"
msgstr "FACT(ຕົວເລກ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1033
msgid "FACT(10) returns 3628800"
msgstr "FACT(10) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 3628800"

#: xml_doc.cc:1034
msgid "FACT(0) returns 1"
msgstr "FACT(0) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1036
msgid ""
"The FACTDOUBLE() function calculates the double factorial of a number, i.e. "
"x!!."
msgstr ""
"FACTDOUBLE() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີິ້ຄິດໄລແບບທົບສອງ"
"ຂອງຄ່າຕົວເລກ, i.e. X!!."

#: xml_doc.cc:1037
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(number)"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(ຕົວເລກ)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1038
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(6) returns 48"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(6) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 48"

#: xml_doc.cc:1039
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(7) returns 105"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 105"

#: xml_doc.cc:1041
msgid ""
"The SUM() function calculates the sum of all the values given as parameters. "
"You can calculate the sum of a range SUM(A1:B5) or a list of values like "
"SUM(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"SUM() "
"ການຄິດໄລທັງຫມົດຄ່າການບວກທ"
"ັງຫມົດຂອງຄ່າພາລາເມເຕີ "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ການບວກດ້ວຍ "
"SUM(A1:B5) ຫລືຄ້າຍຄືກັນ SUM(12;5;12.5)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1042 xml_doc.cc:1047
msgid "SUM(value;value;...)"
msgstr "SUM(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1043
msgid "SUM(12;5;7) equals 24"
msgstr "SUM(12;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 24"

#: xml_doc.cc:1044
msgid "SUM(12.5;2) equals 14.5"
msgstr "SUM(12.5;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 14.5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1046
msgid ""
"The SUMA() function calculates the sum of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the sum of a range SUMA(A1:B5) or a list of "
"values like SUMA(12;5;12.5). If a parameter contains text or the boolean "
"value FALSE it is counted as 0, if a parameter evaluates to TRUE it is "
"counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"SUMA() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຄິດໄລ່ການບວກທັງ"
"ຫມົດຂອງຄ່າທີ່ໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕິ."
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ SUMA(A1:B5) ຫລື  SUMA(12;5;12.5). "
"ຖ້າພາລາມິເຕີບັນຈຸຫລື "
"ຜົນບູລິນ ຄ່າຜິດມັນແມ່ນນັບ 0, "
"ຖ້າພາລາມິເຕີແມ່ນຄ່າຖືກມັນ"
"ແມ່ນ1."

#: xml_doc.cc:1048
msgid "SUMA(12;5; 7) equals 24"
msgstr "SUM(12;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 24"

#: xml_doc.cc:1049
msgid "SUMA(12.5; 2; TRUE) equals 15.5"
msgstr "SUM(12.5;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກບັ 14.5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1051
msgid ""
"The PRODUCT() function calculates the product of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the product of a range: PRODUCT(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like product(12;5;12.5). If no numeric values are found 0 is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"PRODUCT() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນການຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຄ່່າທັ"
"ງໝົດໃຫ້່ຄ່າພາລາມີິເຕີ.ທ່ານ"
"ສາມາຄິດໄລ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ :PRODUCT(A1:B5) "
"ຫລືຕົວຢ່າງ (12;5;12.5). "
"ຖ້າຕົວເລກແມ່ນຫາຄ່າແມ່ນ 0 "
"ແມ່ນກັບຄິນ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1052
msgid "PRODUCT(value;value;...)"
msgstr "PRODUCT(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1053
msgid "PRODUCT(3;5;7) equals 105"
msgstr "PRODUCT(3;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 105"

#: xml_doc.cc:1054
msgid "PRODUCT(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "PRODUCT(12.5;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 25"

#: xml_doc.cc:1056
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The KPRODUCT() function calculates the product of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the product of a range: KPRODUCT(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like KPRODUCT(12;5;12.5). If no numeric values are found 1 is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"KPRODUCT() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນການຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍຄ່າທັງ"
"ໝົດພາລາມີເຕີ.ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດໄ"
"ລ່ : KPRODUCT(A1:B5) ຫລືຕົວຢ່າງ (12;5;12.5). "
"ຖ້່າບໍ່ມີຕົວເລກຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າ1ສົ"
"່ງກັບ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1057
msgid "KPRODUCT(value;value;...)"
msgstr "PRODUCT(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1058
msgid "KPRODUCT(3;5;7) equals 105"
msgstr "PRODUCT(3;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 105"

#: xml_doc.cc:1059
msgid "KPRODUCT(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "PRODUCT(12.5;2) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 25"

#: xml_doc.cc:1061
msgid ""
"The DIV() function divides the first value by the other values in turn. You "
"can calculate using a range: DIV(A1:B5) or a list of values like "
"DIV(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"DIV() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທຳອິດໂດຍ"
"ຄ່າຈະສົ່ງກັບ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍ: "
"DIV(A1:B5)ຫລືແບບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້DIV(12;5;12.5)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1062
msgid "DIV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "DIV(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1063
msgid "DIV(20;2;2) returns 5"
msgstr "DIV(20;2;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1064
msgid "DIV(25;2.5) returns 10"
msgstr "DIV(25;2.5) ຈະໄ້ດ້ຄ່າ 10"

#: xml_doc.cc:1066
msgid ""
"The SUMSQ() function calculates the sum of all the squares of values given "
"as parameters. You can calculate the sum of a range SUMSQ(A1:B5) or a list "
"of values like SUMSQ(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"The SUMSQ() ແມ່ນການຄິດໄລ່ "
"ການບວກທັງຫມົດຂອງຄ່າຮາກຂອງ"
"ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕ.ທ່ານສາມາ"
"ຄິດໄລ່ໄດ້ SUMSQ(A1:B5) ຫລືຕົວຢ່າງ "
"SUMSQ(12;5;12.5)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1067
msgid "SUMSQ(value;value;...)"
msgstr "SUMSQ(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1068
msgid "SUMSQ(12;5;7) equals 218"
msgstr "SUMSQ(12;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກບັ 218"

#: xml_doc.cc:1069
msgid "SUMSQ(12.5;2) equals 173"
msgstr "SUMSQ(12.5;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 173"

#: xml_doc.cc:1071
msgid "The MAX() function returns the largest value given in the parameters."
msgstr ""
"MAX() "
"ແມ່ນການສົ່ງຄ່າໃຫຍ່ເພື່ອໃຫ"
"້ກັບພາລາມີເຕີ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1072
msgid "MAX(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MAX(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1073
msgid "MAX(12;5;7) returns 12"
msgstr "MAX(12;5;7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 12"

#: xml_doc.cc:1074
msgid "MAX(12.5;2) returns 12.5"
msgstr "MAX(12.5;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ12.5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1076
msgid ""
"The MAXA() function returns the largest value given in the parameters "
"without ignoring boolean values. TRUE evaluates to 1, FALSE evaluates to 0."
msgstr ""
"MAXA() "
"ຟງັຊ້ນສົ່ງຄ່າໃຫຍ່ໃຫ້ພາລາມ"
"ີເຕປາດສະຈາກບູລີ. TRUE ແມ່ນ 1, FALSE "
"ແມ່ນຄ່າ 0."

#: xml_doc.cc:1077
msgid "MAXA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MAX(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1078
msgid "MAXA(12;5; 7) returns 12"
msgstr "MAX(12;5;7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 12"

#: xml_doc.cc:1079
msgid "MAXA(12.5; 2) returns 12.5"
msgstr "MAX(12.5;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 12.5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1080
msgid "MAXA(0.5; 0.4; TRUE; 0.2) returns 1"
msgstr "MAX(12.5;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ12.5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1082
msgid "The MIN() function returns the smallest value given in the parameters."
msgstr ""
"MIN() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້່ສົ່ງຄ່ານ້ອຍໃຫ້"
"ແກ່ພາລາມີເຕີ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1083
msgid "MIN(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MIN(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1084
msgid "MIN(12;5;7) returns 5"
msgstr "MIN(12;5;7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1085
msgid "MIN(12.5;2) returns 2"
msgstr "MIN(12.5;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:1087
msgid ""
"The MINA() function returns the smallest value given in the parameters "
"without ignoring boolean values: TRUE evaluates to 1, FALSE to 0."
msgstr ""
" MINA() "
"ສົງຄ່ານອ້ຍໃຫ້ພາລາມີເຕີປາດ"
"ສະຈາກບູລີ : TRUE  ແມ່ນ 1, FALSE ແມ່ນ 0."

#: xml_doc.cc:1088
msgid "MINA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MIN(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1089
msgid "MINA(12;5; 7) returns 5"
msgstr "MIN(12;5;7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1090
msgid "MINA(12.5; 2) returns 2"
msgstr "MIN(12.5;2) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 2"

#: xml_doc.cc:1091
msgid "MINA(0.4; 2; FALSE; 0.7) returns 0"
msgstr "MIN(12;5;7) ຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 5"

#: xml_doc.cc:1093
msgid ""
"The MULTIPLY() function multiplies all the values given in the parameters. "
"You can multiply values given by a range MULTIPLY(A1:B5) or a list of values "
"like MULTIPLY(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"MULTIPLY() "
"ແມ່ນການໃຫ້ຄ່າແບບຫລາຍໂດຍນຳ"
"ໃຫ້ພາລາມີເຕີ.ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄ"
"ດ້ໂດຍການ MULTIPLY(A1:B5) "
"ຫລືແບບຕົວຢ່າງ MULTIPLY(12;5;12.5)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1094
msgid "MULTIPLY(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ;...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1095
msgid "MULTIPLY(12;5;7) equals 420"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(12;5;7) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 420"

#: xml_doc.cc:1096
msgid "MULTIPLY(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(12.5;2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 25"

#: xml_doc.cc:1098
msgid ""
"The MULTINOMIAL() function returns the multinomial of each number in the "
"parameters. It uses this formula for MULTINOMIAL(a,b,c):"
msgstr ""
"MULTINOMIAL() "
"ແມ່ນສົ່ງຄ່າໂດຍຫລາຍແຕ່ລະຕົ"
"ວເລກໃນພາລາມີເຕີ ໃຊ້ສູດແມ່ນ "
"MULTINOMIAL(a,b,c):"

#: xml_doc.cc:1099
msgid "(a+b+c)! / a!b!c!"
msgstr "(a+b+c)! / a!b!c!"

#: xml_doc.cc:1100
msgid "MULTINOMIAL(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MULTINOMIAL(ຄ່າ;ຄ່າ...)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1101
msgid "MULTINOMIAL(3;4;5) equals 27720"
msgstr "MULTINOMIAL(3;4;5) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 27720"

#: xml_doc.cc:1103
msgid ""
"The SQRT() function returns the non-negative square root of x. If x is "
"negative, \"NaN\" is returned."
msgstr ""
"SQRT() "
"ແມ່ນການສົ່ງຄ່າກັບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ"
"່ນຕົວປະຕິີເສດ ຮາກຂັ້ນສອງ x. "
"ຖ້າ x ແມ່ນປະຕິເສດ, \"NaN\" "
"ແມ່ນກັບຄືນ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1104
msgid "SQRT(x)"
msgstr "SQRT(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1105
msgid "SQRT(9) equals 3"
msgstr "SQRT(9) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 3"

#: xml_doc.cc:1106
msgid "SQRT(-9) equals \"NaN\""
msgstr "SQRT(-9) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ \"NaN\""

#: xml_doc.cc:1108
msgid "The SQRTPI() function returns the non-negative square root of x * PI."
msgstr "The SQRTPI() function returns the non-negative square root of x * PI."

#: xml_doc.cc:1109
msgid "SQRTPI(x)"
msgstr "SQRTPI(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1110
msgid "SQRTPI(2) equals 2.506628"
msgstr "SQRTPI(2) ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 2.506628"

#: xml_doc.cc:1112
msgid "The LN() function returns the natural logarithm of x."
msgstr "The LN() function returns the natural logarithm of x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1113
msgid "LN(x)"
msgstr "LN(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1114
msgid "LN(0.8) equals -0.22314355"
msgstr "LN(0.8) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -0.22314355"

#: xml_doc.cc:1115
msgid "LN(0) equals -inf"
msgstr "LN(0) ມິຄ່າເທົາກັບ -inf"

#: xml_doc.cc:1118
msgid "The LOGn() function returns the base n logarithm of x."
msgstr "The LOGn() function returns the base n logarithm of x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1119
msgid "LOGn(value;base)"
msgstr "LOGn(value;base)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1120
msgid "LOGn(12;10) equals 1.07918125"
msgstr "LOGn(12;10) equals 1.07918125"

#: xml_doc.cc:1121
msgid "LOGn(12;2) equals 3.5849625"
msgstr "LOGn(12;2) equals 3.5849625"

#: xml_doc.cc:1124
msgid "The ROOTN() function returns the non-negative nth root of x."
msgstr "The ROOTN() function returns the non-negative nth root of x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1125
msgid "ROOTN(x;n)"
msgstr "ROOTN(x;n)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1126
msgid "ROOTN(9;2) equals 3"
msgstr "ROOTN(9;2) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 3"

#: xml_doc.cc:1128
msgid "The CUR() function returns the non-negative cube root of x."
msgstr ""
"CUR() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຂອງ"
"ຮາກກຳລັງສາມ x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1129
msgid "CUR(x)"
msgstr "CUR(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1130
msgid "CUR(27) equals 3"
msgstr "CUR(27) equals 3"

#: xml_doc.cc:1132
msgid "The LOG() function returns the base-10 logarithm of x."
msgstr ""
" LOG() ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ "
"logພື້ນ 10 x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1133
msgid "LOG(x)"
msgstr "LOG(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1134
msgid "LOG(0.8) equals -0.09691001"
msgstr "LOG(0.8) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -0.09691001"

#: xml_doc.cc:1135
msgid "LOG(0) equals -inf."
msgstr "LOG(0) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -inf."

#: xml_doc.cc:1137
msgid ""
"The EXP() function returns the value of e (the base of natural logarithms) "
"raised to the power of x."
msgstr ""
"EXP() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຂອງ"
"ຈຳນວນ e (log ພື້ນທຳມະຊາດ) "
"ຂື້ນກຳລັງຂອງ x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1138
msgid "EXP(x)"
msgstr "EXP(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1139
msgid "EXP(9) equals 8 103.08392758"
msgstr "EXP(9) equals 8 103.08392758"

#: xml_doc.cc:1140
msgid "EXP(-9) equals 0.00012341"
msgstr "EXP(-9) equals 0.00012341"

#: xml_doc.cc:1142
msgid ""
"The CEIL() function rounds x up to the nearest integer, returning that value "
"as a double."
msgstr ""
"CEIL() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບໄກຄ"
"ຽງຂອງຄ່າຖ້ວນ, "
"ກຳລັງສອງຄ່າເປັນສອງທົບ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1143
msgid "CEIL(x)"
msgstr "CEIL(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1144
msgid "CEIL(12.5) equals 13"
msgstr "cos(0) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1.0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1145
msgid "CEIL(-12.5) equals -12"
msgstr "CEIL(-12.5) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -12"

#: xml_doc.cc:1147
msgid "Significance (optional)"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: xml_doc.cc:1148
msgid "The CEILING() function rounds x up to the nearest multiple of significance."
msgstr ""
" CEILING() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ x "
"ຂື້ນເປັນການບວກຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງຂອ"
"ງຕົວສຳຄັນ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1149
msgid "CEILING(x)"
msgstr "CEILLN(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1150
msgid "CEILING(12.5) equals 13"
msgstr "cos(0) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1.0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1151
msgid "CEILING(6.43; 4) equals 8"
msgstr "cos(0) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 1.0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1153
msgid ""
"The FLOOR() function rounds x down to the nearest integer, returning that "
"value as a double."
msgstr ""
"FLOOR() ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ x "
"ລົງໃກ້ຄຽງຂອງຄ່າຖ້ວນສົ່ງກັ"
"ບເປັນຄ່າສອງທົບ."

#: xml_doc.cc:1154
msgid "FLOOR(x)"
msgstr "FLOOR(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1155
msgid "FLOOR(12.5) equals 12"
msgstr "FLOOR(12.5) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 12"

#: xml_doc.cc:1156
msgid "FLOOR(-12.5) equals -13"
msgstr "FLOOR(-12.5) ມິຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ -13"

#: xml_doc.cc:1158
msgid "The ABS() function returns the absolute value of the floating-point number x."
msgstr ""
"ABS() "
"ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຄ່າ"
"ສົມບູນຂອງຄ່າເສດຂອງຕົວເລກ x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1159
msgid "ABS(x)"
msgstr "ABS(x)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1160
msgid "ABS(12.5) equals 12.5"
